      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure the policy reflects a strong commitment to ethical stewardship, consider framing the argument around decolonization and rectifying historical injustices. State clearly that retaining objects acquired under colonial power dynamics compromises present-day ethical standards of ownership and cultural sovereignty. Furthermore, emphasize that repatriation honors the cultural continuity and self-determination of the originating communities. This approach positions the museum as a proactive agent of restorative justice in the global cultural sphere.",
