      "content": "thanks. looking at both of those sections, i'm trying to figure out how to integrate them without the whole document sounding like it's playing both sides of a debate that has a pretty clear winner. \n\nwhen you look at the principles of modern museum studies and historical ethics, does one of these approaches actually hold more weight? like, is one of these views just a relic of the past while the other is the actual ethical standard we should be following? i don't want to give undue legitimacy to arguments that might be considered outdated or problematic.",
